    "text": "The value of $\\lim _{n \\rightarrow\\infty}\\left[\\frac{n}{n^{2}+1^{2}}+\\frac{n}{n^{2}+2^{2}}+\\ldots+\\frac{1}{2 n}\\right]$ is"
