  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{n \\rightarrow-}\\left[\\frac{n}{n^{2}+1^{2}}+\\frac{n}{n^{2}+2^{2}}+\\ldots+\\frac{1}{2 n}\\right]$\r\n$=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow-}\\left[\\frac{n}{n^{2}+1^{2}}+\\frac{n}{n^{2}+2^{2}}+\\ldots+\\frac{n}{n^{2}+n^{2}}\\right]$\r\n$=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow-} \\sum_{r=1}^{-\\infty} \\frac{n}{n^{2}+r^{2}}$\r\n$=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow-\\infty} \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{r=1}^{-\\infty} \\frac{1}{1+\\left(\\frac{r}{n}\\right)^{2}}$\r\n$\\quad=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{1+x^{2}} d x$\r\n$\\quad=\\left[\\tan ^{-1} x\\right]_{0}^{1}$\r\n$\\quad=\\tan ^{-1} 1-\\tan ^{-1} 0$\r\n$\\quad=\\frac{\\pi}{4}-0=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$"
  }
